      "cooked": "<p>I may be really over-thinking things, but I was wondering if cards that say you may play two cards during your turn allow you to immediately play a second card when they come into play? I don’t have my decks in front of me but I believe Tachyon has a card that lets you play two cards a turn.</p>\n<p>I have already decided that cards that let you use two powers a turn take effect immediately, but correct me if I’m wrong on that point too.</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance.</p>",
